<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina's mortgage bank to lend $1.2 bln in '97.</title>
<headline>Argentina's mortgage bank to lend $1.2 bln in '97.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine President Carlos Menem said on Monday state-run mortgage bank BHN will this year channel $1.2 billion in loans to build or buy houses.</p>
<p>&quot;In 1995 the bank lended more than $400 million, in 1996 more than $800 and this year it will lend at least $1.2 billion,&quot; Menem told reporters.</p>
<p>((Guillermo Haskel, Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-0650))</p>
